(j) "enrolled person" means an under-officer or other person enrolled under this
Act;

(k) "Force" means the Indo-Tibetan Border Police Force;

(l) "Force Court" means a Court referred to in section 76;

(m) "Force custody" means the arrest or confinement of a member of the Force
